== Walkthrough ==

Hand the [[Mercenary Assignments]] into Sentry Kcor, 1 to 4 at a time. '''Works with dubious faction.'''

He'll give you some copper, silver, gold and platinum, along with...

<div class='facblock'>
* Your faction standing with [[Claws of Veeshan]] got better. <span class='oppfac'>(+6)</span>
* Your faction standing with [[Yelinak]] got better.  <span class='oppfac'>(+6)</span>
* Your faction standing with [[Kromzek]] got worse.
</div>

From just barely indifferent, it took me 14 assignment hand-ins and 6 mercenary kills to go from indifferent to amiable.

